    "turn_text": "May 20th. I'm Virginia Allen. And I'm Rachel Deljudas. Democrats passed proxy voting in their fourth coronavirus recovery bill on Friday. What is proxy voting? How does it take power away from the American people and give it over to a select few legislators who cast votes on behalf of their colleagues? House Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy joins me on the Daily Signal Podcast to unpack what all this means.",
