    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "Well, how it would affect them personally, I'm sure Nancy Pelosi will get their votes. So they may be a moderate or say they are, but they're going to give their vote to the liberal wing of the party, and they're going to have no say. They don't have an ability inside a committee to change the course, to make the bill different or better. It only comes to the floor. And they have no control over beating back because one member stands up there. Here's 10 votes to year one.",
